/* 岩友圈列表页：卡片/按钮/标签/图标按钮均使用全局体系，本文件只保留列表布局 */
.page--circle-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.topbar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16rpx;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.list-stage {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.circle-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
}

.circle-row__color {
  width: 72rpx;
  height: 72rpx;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.circle-row__main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.circle-row__title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #fff;
}

.circle-row__meta {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: rgba(231, 233, 243, 0.55);
  margin-top: 6rpx;
}

.circle-row__desc {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: rgba(231, 233, 243, 0.45);
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.circle-row__side {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
